    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "Create a daily stock market email using the stock data provided below.\n\nThe data has already been calculated and ranked. Do not recalculate it.\n\nWrite the actual values into the email.\n\nInclude:\n\n1. A \"Daily Stock Market Summary\" heading.\n2. An \"All Stocks\" section showing every stock's ticker, closing price, and percentage change.\n3. A \"Biggest Gainers\" section showing the 3 stocks in the gainers array.\n4. A \"Biggest Losers\" section showing the 3 stocks in the losers array.\n5. An \"Overall Assessment\" section describing whether the market was generally positive, negative, or mixed based on the provided data.\n\nReturn ONLY the completed HTML email.\n\nUse only:\n\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>\n\nDo NOT use Markdown.\nDo NOT use ```html.\nDo NOT use {{#each}}.\nDo NOT use placeholders such as {{ticker}}, {{close}}, or {{change}}.\nDo NOT say that data is missing.\nDo NOT ask for additional information.\n\nHere is the actual data:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n",
        "options": {}
      },
